{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beneath the roaring 1898 frontier expansion are the cries of those who are left behind. Follow the disgraced ex-ranger, The Drifter, on his path to redemption as he attempts to root out the corruption of a failing state. Acting as his unexpected partner is The Enforcer, a bold ranger scout with dreams of an equitable future. Build up a posse to reclaim the future!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select an ally and pack your turns full of actions! Follow the intuitive control scheme to seamlessly strategize against the intimidating wave of enemies. Once in range, you're ready for a quick draw.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824630/extras/cb9cce8cd8ade515e3a6da6067ecce13.poster.avif?t=1771897388\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824630/extras/cb9cce8cd8ade515e3a6da6067ecce13.webm?t=1771897388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824630/extras/cb9cce8cd8ade515e3a6da6067ecce13.mp4?t=1771897388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nail the timing during tense duels! Deviation will randomly affect your aim, so only fire when you have the enemy pinned down! Will you inflict more damage as you steady your hand or take the first shot?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824630/extras/145007ed22798027563d2105b370cab6.poster.avif?t=1771897388\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824630/extras/145007ed22798027563d2105b370cab6.webm?t=1771897388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824630/extras/145007ed22798027563d2105b370cab6.mp4?t=1771897388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the battle indoors to duke it out in hectic brawls! Enter buildings to rescue townsfolk, and nearby teammates will join you during these heroics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824630/extras/09deb886ba232d501e3c4b9968c944de.poster.avif?t=1771897388\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824630/extras/09deb886ba232d501e3c4b9968c944de.webm?t=1771897388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824630/extras/09deb886ba232d501e3c4b9968c944de.mp4?t=1771897388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Against stacked odds, grit your teeth and stand tall alongside fierce comrades. Spend time with them throughout your campaign to bolster bonds and witness their growth on and off the battlefield. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824630/extras/f225b750912a13ddc5cf1af14cb9a535.avif?t=1771897388\" width=1313 height=611 /></span>  </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3824630?t=1771897388","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3824630?t=1771897388","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824630/eb198e89abbc6c3ce234105930ac1066565c5927/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771897388",