paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824630/extras/145007ed22798027563d2105b370cab6.poster.avif?t=1771897388\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824630/extras/145007ed22798027563d2105b370cab6.webm?t=1771897388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824630/extras/145007ed22798027563d2105b370cab6.mp4?t=1771897388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the battle indoors to duke it out in hectic brawls! Enter buildings to rescue townsfolk, and nearby teammates will join you during these heroics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824630/extras/09deb886ba232d501e3c4b9968c944de.poster.avif?t=1771897388\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824630/extras/09deb886ba232d501e3c4b9968c944de.webm?t=1771897388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824630/extras/09deb886ba232d501e3c4b9968c944de.mp4?t=1771897388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Against stacked odds, grit your teeth and stand tall alongside fierce comrades. Spend time with them throughout your campaign to bolster bonds and witness their growth on and off the battlefield. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824630/extras/f225b750912a13ddc5cf1af14cb9a535.avif?t=1771897388\" width=1313 height=611 /><