22654c0831fdd3d78b/ss_5b9a8d003c9e27d867101522654c0831fdd3d78b.600x338.jpg?t=1771897388"}],"short_description":"Drifter Dynasty is a strategy role-playing game featuring thrilling brawls and tense duels. A lone drifter meets a willful ranger at the crossroads of a political power struggle. The stage is set for a multi-generational Western epic. Will you saddle up for a new frontier?","steam_appid":3824630,"support_info":{"email":"drifterdynasty@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English","type":"game","website":null}